<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-BankUnited said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BankUnited said upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James has upgraded its rating of BankUnited Financial Corp to a buy from an accumulate, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at nine in early trading.</p>
</text>
